# Felwood & Winterspring (52-53): the first Horde visit of Felwood and Winterspring, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/felwood_winterspring_52_53.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Felwood, area 361, and
# Winterspring, area 618). The guide's quest list is section 18 of
# addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md; the rest of Felwood and Winterspring is in Felwood &
# Winterspring (54-56) and Winterspring (58-59).
# Carried in: Delivery to Jes'rimon (3541), from Jediga in Azshara (Burning Steppes & Azshara);
# It's a Secret to Everybody (3908), from Linken at Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro Crater (Feralas &
# Un'Goro Crater); Felnok Steelspring (4808), from Tinkee Steamboil in the Burning Steppes (Burning
# Steppes & Azshara).
# Left to later guides: Jes'rimon's Payment to Jediga (3563, Azshara), Seeking Spiritual Aid (5158,
# the Barrens), The Videre Elixir (3909) and Falling to Corruption (5084): follow-ups taken where
# this guide hands in their quest.
# Passed through: The Strength of Corruption (4120), from Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas,
# handed in by a later guide; its grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers live only in northern Felwood, so
# this guide kills them (the steps skip themselves without the quest).
# Timbermaw Hold starts Hostile: the Deadwood kills and Timbermaw Ally bring it to Unfriendly, which
# lets you through the furbolg tunnel to Winterspring.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (Jes'rimon, training); a flight to Splintertree Post and a ride north to the
# Emerald Sanctuary; Jaedenar and Bloodvenom Post; the Ruins of Constellas, the Deadwood camp and
# Overlord Ror; the Emerald Sanctuary; the Jaedenar moonwell, Bloodvenom Post again, Shatter Scar
# Vale and Irontree Woods; Nafien and the Timbermaw tunnel to Winterspring; Donova Snowden and the
# Winterfall camps; Everlook; a flight back to Bloodvenom Post, the Emerald Sanctuary, and a flight
# to Orgrimmar for Un'Goro Crater.

guide Felwood & Winterspring (52-53)
faction horde
levels 52 53
carry 3518 3541 3568 3908 4120 4494 4808
leave 3518 3563 3568 3909 4120 4494 5084 5158
next Un'Goro Crater (53-54)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
hearth npc 6929
tip The last guide set your hearthstone in Orgrimmar. Already in Orgrimmar? Skip it.
turnin 3541
tip Jes'rimon stands in the Cleft of Shadow.
accept 3563
tip Keep his note: Jediga gets it in a later Azshara guide.
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity or Thunder Bluff, druids in Thunder Bluff.
fly "Splintertree Post, Ashenvale" npc 3310
tip Ride west along the road, then take the road north into Felwood: the Emerald Sanctuary is just past the border. If you already know Bloodvenom Post, fly there and ride south down the road instead.

# The Emerald Sanctuary ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Felwood
accept 8460
accept 5155
accept 5156
tip Taronn Redfeather is inside the building.
accept 4102
tip Maybess Riverbreeze stands a little west of the sanctuary.

# Jaedenar and Bloodvenom Post ------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 5155
tip Jaedenar is the Shadow Council camp along the road north-west. More of them are inside the caves; leave the moonwell in the middle for later. The Adepts blink away and hit hard with Fireball and Fire Blast: kill them first.
fpath 11900
accept 4505
accept 6162

# The Ruins of Constellas, the Deadwood camp and Overlord Ror ----------------------------------------

do 4505 icon use "Use the Hardened Flasket at the corrupted moonwell in the Ruins of Constellas"
tip Jadefire Shadowstalkers are stealthed, some on patrol, and their poison slows hard: watch your back on the way in.
do 8460
tip The Deadwood camp is just south-west of the Emerald Sanctuary. The kills and the quest bring Timbermaw Hold from Hostile to Unfriendly; kill a few extra furbolgs to be safe, as the Timbermaw in the tunnel to Winterspring attack anyone still Hostile.
do 6162
tip Overlord Ror stands at the south end of the Deadwood camp, near the Ashenvale border. Clear the furbolgs around him first: his fear sends you running into them.

# The Emerald Sanctuary -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 8460
accept 8462
turnin 5155
accept 5157

# Jaedenar, Bloodvenom Post, Shatter Scar Vale and Irontree Woods ------------------------------------

do 5157 icon use "Fill the Empty Canteen at the moonwell in the middle of Jaedenar"
tip Cultists and guardians stand around the moonwell: clear them before you fill the canteen.
turnin 4505
tip Leave Winna's next task, Corrupted Sabers, for the later Felwood guide.
turnin 6162
do 5156.1 bg
do 5156.2 bg
do 5156.3 at 41.0,42.0 icon text "Explore the craters of Shatter Scar Vale"
tip The vale is east of the road north of Bloodvenom Post: running into one crater is enough. Infernals walk it too: they hit hard, so pull them alone or go around. The Entropic Beasts and Horrors share spawn points, so you may need a few extra of either.
do 5156.1
do 5156.2
do 4120.1 bg
do 4120.2 bg
do 4102
tip Moss Flayers and Shredders, the treants of Irontree Woods, drop the Blood Amber. Dessecus, a rare elite treant, walks there too.
do 4120.1
do 4120.2
tip Only if you took The Strength of Corruption from Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache: the grizzlies and the Felpaw Ravagers roam the woods on both sides of the road from Irontree Woods up to Timbermaw Hold.
turnin 8462
tip Nafien guards the mouth of Timbermaw Hold at the north end of the road. Leave his next task, Deadwood of the North, for the later Felwood guide.

# Winterspring ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Walk through the Timbermaw Hold tunnel to Winterspring" at 28.0,34.6 in Winterspring r 40
tip Keep to the main path: the branch to Moonglade leaves halfway through.
map Winterspring
turnin 3908
accept 3909
tip The Videre Elixir is for a later guide: keep it in your log.
accept 5082
tip Donova Snowden camps by the hot springs.
do 5082.1 bg at 32.3,36.3
do 5082.2 bg at 31.6,36.4
do 5082.3 bg at 31.8,36.7
accept 5083 at 32.0,36.5
tip The Empty Firewater Flask drops from the Winterfall furbolgs, rarely and for one of you at a time: right-click it to start the quest.
do 5082.1 at 32.3,36.3
do 5082.3 at 31.8,36.7
tip The Winterfall camp is just north of Donova; a second camp of Pathfinders and Totemics sits on the hills to the east, around 40,43.
do 5082.2 at 31.6,36.4
tip Only a handful of Den Watchers live in this camp: kill the others while they come back.
turnin 5082 5083
accept 5084

# Everlook --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 4808
tip Felnok Steelspring is upstairs in the inn. Leave his next task, Chillwind Horns, for a later guide.
fpath 11139
fly "Bloodvenom Post, Felwood" npc 11139

# The Emerald Sanctuary, then on to Un'Goro Crater -------------------------------------------------

map Felwood
turnin 5156
turnin 4102
turnin 5157
accept 5158
tip Keep the water: a later guide takes it to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens.
fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 11900
tip Ride back up the road to Bloodvenom Post for the flight. The Un'Goro Crater guide starts in Orgrimmar (the auction house), then Ratchet and Gadgetzan.
